content:
Help me define bounded contexts. Below I will provide domain information. 

#### Data:
These are the extracted objects and the subdomain grouping:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Guest",
      "description": "person visiting the park with access to attractions"
    },
    {
      "name": "Day Pass",
      "description": "ticket that lets a guest enter the park"
    },
    {
      "name": "Check In",
      "description": "record of a guest entering an attraction"
    },
    {
      "name": "Attraction",
      "description": "ride or show location in the park",
      "attributes": [
        "Ride Time Slot"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Ride Time Slot",
      "description": "reserved time window for a guest to ride"
    },
    {
      "name": "Ride Operator",
      "description": "staff member running and supervising a ride"
    },
    {
      "name": "Safety Check",
      "description": "quick check to make sure a ride is safe to run"
    },
    {
      "name": "Maintenance Technician",
      "description": "staff member handling attraction repairs"
    },
    {
      "name": "Malfunction Inspection",
      "description": "review of a broken attraction to find issues"
    },
    {
      "name": "Replacement Part Order",
      "description": "request for parts needed to fix an attraction"
    },
    {
      "name": "Entertainment Manager",
      "description": "staff coordinating live shows and performers"
    },
    {
      "name": "Live Show",
      "description": "scheduled performance linked to an attraction",
      "attributes": [
        "Performer",
        "Attraction"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Performer",
      "description": "person taking part in a live show"
    },
    {
      "name": "Park Administrator",
      "description": "staff overseeing operations and communication"
    },
    {
      "name": "Messaging",
      "description": "communication exchanged between park staff"
    },
    {
      "name": "Customer Feedback",
      "description": "input from guests about their experience"
    }
  ]
}
```
```json
{
  "subdomains": {
    "Ride Operation": {
      "objects": [
        "Ride Operator",
        "Attraction",
        "Safety Check",
        "Ride Time Slot"
      ]
    },
    "Live Shows": {
      "objects": [
        "Entertainment Manager",
        "Performer",
        "Live Show",
        "Attraction"
      ]
    },
    "Administration": {
      "objects": [
        "Park Administrator",
        "Customer Feedback",
        "Messaging"
      ]
    },
    "Booking": {
      "objects": [
        "Guest",
        "Day Pass",
        "Check In",
        "Ride Time Slot"
      ]
    },
    "Maintenance": {
      "objects": [
        "Maintenance Technician",
        "Malfunction Inspection",
        "Replacement Part Order"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

#### Task:
- Assign the subdomains to bounded contexts. 
- Name the subdomain the bounded context might be derived from, it might also be multiple.
- Identify cases, where an object does not have a unified meaning across all bounded contexts and suggest a name change.
- Return the bounded contexts in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "... -> ..."
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

Here are the bounded contexts: 
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "Ride Operation": {
      "derived from": "Ride Operation Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Ride Operator",
        "Attraction",
        "Safety Check",
        "Ride Time Slot"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "Live Shows": {
      "derived from": "Live Shows Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Entertainment Manager",
        "Performer",
        "Live Show",
        "Show Venue"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Attraction -> Show Venue"
      ]
    },
    "Administration": {
      "derived from": "Administration Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Park Administrator",
        "Customer Feedback",
        "Messaging"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "Booking": {
      "derived from": "Booking Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Guest",
        "Day Pass",
        "Check In",
        "Time Slot Booking"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Ride Time Slot -> Time Slot Booking"
      ]
    },
    "Maintenance": {
      "derived from": "Maintenance Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Maintenance Technician",
        "Malfunction Inspection",
        "Replacement Part Order"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    }
  }
}
```
